Prerequisite : 
- Python3
- Python Module request

Config Prereq :
yum -y install python3
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
python3 -m pip install requests

Collect Info :
-- Define Variable --
export AAP_USER=changeme
export AAP_PASS='changeme'
export AAP_URL='https://changeme'

python3 get-workflow-detail.py ID_WORKFLOW_TEMPLATE > namafile.csv
example :
python3 get-workflow-detail.py  625 > dummy-file.csv

Output nya akan sebagai berikut :

workflow_template_name	node_alias	node_type	     resource_name	      playbook
WORKFLOW_1              Node-1      job_template   nama_job_tempalate   /aap/hello-test.yml



